PaymentRails_Constructor
├── when initialOwner is zero address
│   └── it should revert with OwnableInvalidOwner
├── when wrappedNative has no code
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_WrappedNativeNotContract
├── when wrappedNative is zero address
│   ├── it should set the owner
│   └── it should set wrappedNative to zero address
└── when wrappedNative is a contract
    ├── it should set the owner
    ├── it should set pendingOwner to zero address
    └── it should set wrappedNative
